{"page":494,"verses":[{"verse_key":"43:61","surah":43,"ayah":61,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَعِلْمٌ لِّلسَّاعَةِ فَلَا تَمْتَرُنَّ بِهَا وَٱتَّبِعُونِ ۚ هَـٰذَا صِرَٰطٌ مُّسْتَقِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This [Quran] gives knowledge of the Hour: do not doubt it. Follow Me for this is the right path;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"And indeed, it","transliteration":"wa-innahu","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَعِلْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"surely (is) a knowledge","transliteration":"laʿil'mun","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِّلسَّاعَةِ","en_gloss":"of the Hour","transliteration":"lilssāʿati","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"So (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَمْتَرُنَّ","en_gloss":"(be) doubtful","transliteration":"tamtarunna","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"about it","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱتَّبِعُونِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and follow Me","transliteration":"wa-ittabiʿūni","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":9,"ar":"صِرَٰطٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is the) Path","transliteration":"ṣirāṭun","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmun","verse_key":"43:61"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٦١","en_gloss":"(61)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:61"}]},{"verse_key":"43:62","surah":43,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَصُدَّنَّكُمُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ لَكُمْ عَدُوٌّ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"do not let Satan hinder you, for he is your sworn enemy.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"43:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَصُدَّنَّكُمُ","en_gloss":"avert you","transliteration":"yaṣuddannakumu","verse_key":"43:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"43:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"